('u5_01_aerial_tourism_meaning','vocab_aerial_tourism','u5_01_aerial_tourism','aerial_tourism_1','meaning_context','Helicopter flights over the glaciers have helped to make aerial tourism a growing business in the region.',null,'["sightseeing from the air"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
